{"product_id":"the-pink-chameleon-silk-sisters","title":"The Pink Chameleon (Silk Sisters)","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn the not too distant future, Rorie and Elsie's parents have disappeared. Just like that. And with only their cruel uncle to look after them, the girls are swept off to his miserable boarding school. But the sisters are determined to escape their uncle's grip - and discover the truth behind their parents' disappearance...A wild and futuristic fashion adventure!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 195\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Fiona Dunbar\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781846162305\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 288\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45174724264089,"sku":"5RG9781846162305","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67bc380354ab3_The_20Pink_20Chameleon_20_Silk_20Sisters_20Fiona_20Dunbar.jpg?v=1752084580","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-pink-chameleon-silk-sisters","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}